  <description promeva:title="Description (English)" promeva:type="104" type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CARE and long-term partners SSWC &amp; TASS propose to address gaps with an integrated Health, Nutrition &amp; MPCA response for 29.736 drought affected vulnerable people in treatment for or at risk of malnutrition; designed to address identified gaps in health and nutrition service delivery and the reduced purchasing power of vulnerable HHs. Protection mainstreaming is done with Vulnerability Based targeting and community based, dignified response to specific needs.</narrative>
  </description>
